{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786897930527401001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"callous-amused-hart","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"fb5eeff01d1929d03ceb82d53f475697615ff3206a878ea5563f3e5cf22bb9be","event_uuid":"04fda44a-3834-4570-8f68-c823e8a4f590","position":{"commit_sha":"2276014d33a88422d50fe6d40df6e44fdf97ddf4","position":"1786892014280155001-04fda44a-3834-4570-8f68-c823e8a4f590"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"216d499cf403fe9ba2447b887cda6cc831cd872b4b4e3245c6cd994e612f2d3e","event_uuid":"691aaed9-fe15-4036-8d42-1135103c2c4e","position":{"commit_sha":"9d0ae5a2bd3b859bfaa0baffec4651d873fa7a2c","position":"1786892042043950001-691aaed9-fe15-4036-8d42-1135103c2c4e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786892014280155001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"691aaed9-fe15-4036-8d42-1135103c2c4e","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"bf7c-333e-29b0-4ee4"}],"description":"## Context\nWhile debugging grindable-deviant-angwantibo, a rival mechanism was falsified for that incident but exposed a separate deterministic liveness gap. tests/conftest.py calls tests/_isolation.py::porcelain during pytest_sessionfinish, after pytest has already printed the per-test `[100%]` progress boundary. `porcelain()` launches `git -C <repo> status --porcelain` with no timeout; the sibling `head()` probe is likewise unbounded.\n\n## Runtime proof\nA fake Git that blocked only the second repo-root status call reproduced the exact post-dot boundary. SIGUSR1 captured subprocess.run/_communicate -> tests/_isolation.py:59 porcelain -> tests/conftest.py:681 pytest_sessionfinish. This was not the grindable incident's root cause: 100 natural status probes were median 0.0143s, p95 0.0164s, max 0.0610s, while the incident's observed stack and discriminating A/B identified pytest numbered-temp cleanup.\n\n## Plan\n- Define a watchdog-grade local timeout for the read-only repo-isolation Git probes without turning a timeout into a false clean result.\n- Exercise the real session-finish lifecycle with a deterministic blocking Git shim and assert a bounded, explicit test-run failure.\n- Cover both porcelain() and head() through their real hook/fixture callers.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A blocking repo-isolation Git probe cannot keep pytest alive beyond a documented local watchdog.\n- [ ] Timeout produces an explicit isolation-infrastructure failure, never `None`/clean success.\n- [ ] Real session-finish and per-test commit-guard paths are covered with deterministic subprocess tests.\n- [ ] Normal repo-isolation behavior and the default unit suite remain green.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["ci","flaky","test-isolation"],"ticket_id":"cf0f-2e26-87ca-47a8","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Repo-isolation session hooks run unbounded Git probes after tests finish","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["04fda44a-3834-4570-8f68-c823e8a4f590","691aaed9-fe15-4036-8d42-1135103c2c4e"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786897930527401001,"uuid":"d599b433-1a97-47a8-8049-ad54a93eea53"}